{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "e883150ade4b76de5c956fd67eada5d06cfd2c6c944ce9e6c56b092b0ff46470", "ja": "え、ホンマ？　あはは、ありがとうな。\n……うん、楽しみにしてるわ！　また今度な～！", "zh": "诶，真的？　哈哈，谢谢你啊。\n……嗯，我很期待哦！下次再聊啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1001_p", "source_sha256": "446a99b9e161c5080f22c1401379cc820ffb4ff84c3ddb206af8e07e06a8f472", "ja": "（奈緒の電話は終わった……かな？\n用事があるけど、もう少し様子を……）", "zh": "（奈绪的电话结束了……吧？我还有事，不过再观察一会儿吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "0b781e9d9f2e92036b95acb4ea998a4852dc22187a064dd00115fcf22a30af46", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nそんなとこで、何してるんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你在那儿干什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8b8e3ae58cdd8a7132a84f2c2f07b657dc9eb6956ec89a17cca045bcfec03c24", "ja": "ああ、服のことで奈緒に話があってね。\n電話はもう大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "啊，我有件关于服装的事要和奈绪谈谈。\n电话已经没事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b528f288beee08c14441e1bc7fa34ffbfb3f05d2d7fd785f85347320e4789b3", "ja": "ちょうど終わったとこですよ。\nいやー、友達とめちゃくちゃ盛り上がってもうて。", "zh": "正好刚打完电话。\n哎呀，和朋友聊得特别起劲，一不小心就聊过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "f8a4cbbf60a50633f06194ebb9912824287f82b6636dcfad5002a96a33a4cd5d", "ja": "思ったより長なりましたけど。この服の感想\n教えてくれたんやから、当然ですよね。", "zh": "虽然聊得比预想的还久，不过既然她们跟我\n分享了这套服装的观后感，那也是理所当然的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9ad7bd27a5ed8388dcd5b85b60e366baaa731de933f6c45b67a1a8823d51a57f", "ja": "へぇ、友達はなんて言ってたんだ？", "zh": "哦，那朋友是怎么说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b7a424a444eb02b821da4c02cb2c67a61d11de7cb405d2e5e5b98aa0bda4b95", "ja": "「あれもこれも、欲張り過ぎやろー！」って、\n笑いながら、ツッコんでました。", "zh": "“这也想要那也想要，太贪心了吧——！”\n她一边笑着，一边这么吐槽我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "d19bf8325c9cb6b06ee1ca329dcd0c720ff77dc0f1821a1333485f37e8cd2c11", "ja": "でも、そういうとこも含めて\n「奈緒らしくてええやん！」って。えへへ♪", "zh": "不过，包括那样的地方在内，\n“这才像奈绪，不是挺好嘛！”嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ff709bec7c149a796d61171741d991a7f89171a143c07c8f08f01b175f6c5cd8", "ja": "ははっ。さすが友達だな。\n確かに、色んな要素が入ってるけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，不愧是朋友啊。确实加入了各种各样的元素，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "068b6f46c250f3ece6dae4d2c9471b4c28a50380032a629f1e941691b6ed324e", "ja": "それが、いい感じにまとまってて。\n奈緒のこだわりとワガママの詰まった一着に見えるよ。", "zh": "这些元素恰到好处地融合在一起了。看起来就像是一件凝聚了奈绪的坚持和任性的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e6bc6f2438bc0c683c5cf18d7b86c2cf995f3c94b96536dee8f83c41179c199", "ja": "そう言うてもらえて、よかったです。……考えだしたら\nキリなくて、ひとつに絞られへんかったから。", "zh": "您能这么说，我就放心了。……一想到要设计，就没完没了，怎么也没法只选一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "2a53db5dd11d7f9577ed6e0c121cf1e7a6099d6170a467038db090694f01b1c9", "ja": "まあ……それもこれも、全部\n{$P$}さんのおかげですけどね。", "zh": "不过……这也多亏了\n{$P$}先生就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "57fbca9553938bca6c11eea310357e3b7c1d15601eea7027ebdbbdd0d6e29f89", "ja": "{$P$}さんやったら、\nこういう時、どうするかなーって思ったんです……。", "zh": "要是{$P$}先生的话，\n这种时候会怎么做呢，我就是这么想了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "733b842fab75765d2c67208ea2ceb4ac9dbb86eaa7b54cc5e879ea9d73fb69c0", "ja": "私ん中の{$P$}さんが\n「ひとつなんて言わずに、全部入れたれー！」って。", "zh": "我心里的{$P$}先生说：“别说一个了，全都放进去——！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1016_p", "source_sha256": "97246d3af08a5e1057b83ff3d59ff29d124ec89f8505d95fc60dcdeebe24bf41", "ja": "俺、そんなイメージなのか……？", "zh": "我在你心里就是这种形象吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "521b72667a0520a5056c2e4bcd752106c95062b961a8525dcdec36815a735874", "ja": "……えへへ。とにかく、答えはひとつやないって、\n{$P$}さんが教えてくれたんです。", "zh": "……嘿嘿。总之，是{$P$}先生告诉我，答案并不只有一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "cced272c9f171aa9e4f379ecbe873bd0d522b494e58a528ac0291c7d93c25018", "ja": "せやからこれからも、私にしか作られへんもんを\n考えてみます！　あ、友達にも、また見てもらわんと。", "zh": "所以今后我也会继续思考，只有我才能做出来的东西！啊，还得再让朋友们帮忙看看才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1019_p", "source_sha256": "57ddbab22d1d70a8a53f4441bf4a87f422ae98d8a64b84a67b3ad82a84f3ec44", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。機会があれば、友達と一緒に\n着れるような双子コーデとかも面白いかもな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。有机会的话，和朋友一起穿双胞胎装之类的，感觉也挺有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0554_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "9811246f38fe83eac6e4a3903e69611b683aedbee7085bbf5581ba68a6e9f53d", "ja": "あ、いいですね！　けど、私より似合ってたら\nイヤやな……。それまで自分磨きも頑張ります……！", "zh": "啊，那不错！不过，要是比我穿着还合适的话，我可不乐意……在那之前，我也会努力提升自己的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
